' The stage set for the package documentation -- see the console template's copy
' of this file for why it exists and why the list is written out rather than
' inferred.
'
' The VB half is the same; the rest are the control instances the
' Reference/Built-In and Tutorials pages assume on their forms.

Module tbxStage

    Public Form1 As Form
    Public UserForm1 As Form
    Public UserForm2 As Form

    Public Text1 As TextBox
    Public Text2 As TextBox
    Public TextBox1 As TextBox

    Public Label1 As Label
    Public Timer1 As Timer
    Public Command1 As CommandButton
    Public Frame1 As Frame
    Public Picture1 As PictureBox
    Public PictureBox1 As PictureBox

    ' Browser controls -- CEF and WebView2.
    Public CefBrowser1 As CefBrowser
    Public WebView21 As WebView2

    ' Windows Native Common Controls.
    Public DTPicker1 As DTPicker
    Public ImageList1 As ImageList
    Public ListView1 As ListView
    Public MonthView1 As MonthView
    Public ProgressBar1 As ProgressBar
    Public Slider1 As Slider
    Public TreeView1 As TreeView
    Public UpDown1 As UpDown

End Module
